/* ================= QA pass (skin-qa session, Nov 16) — fixes found on the full screen × skin × rendition sweep ================= */
/* ⋯ menu on someone else's profile: items in the skin's own ink (they were dark-on-dark in Good Witch Night / HL Twilight) */
html body.fs .fs-pv-menu a:not(.fs-pv-danger), html body.fs .fs-pv-menu a:not(.fs-pv-danger) i { color: var(--fs-ink) !important; }
/* Vaporwave: the concept puts ⋯ in the button row, as one more window button (fullskins.js puts it in .pv-actions) */
