/* My Profile pop-up: skins without an avatar mask (Vaporwave, Heaven's Light) lost the photo (the mask URL 404s → nothing
   drawn), and Anime Blaze's cut-in mask left light shards around it. Those three show the photo as a plain circle. */
html body.fs:is(.fs-vaporwave, .fs-heavens-light, .fs-anime-blaze) .modal-profile-top img { -webkit-mask: none !important; mask: none !important;
  border-radius: 50% !important; width: min(180px, 60%) !important; }
