/* ======================================================================================
   #BASIC v2 — "AESTHETIC WIDGETS" (owner redesign, Nov 17 2026: the shelf "literally doesn't look good").
   Concepts images/skins/basic/concept-w-{rose,pumpkin}[-2|-barista].png (local), crops prototypes/reference/basic-w-*/,
   kit brief prototypes/basic-widgets-kit-brief.md. The whole app = a beige "aesthetic iPhone home screen": soft wallpaper,
   every card a frosted cream glass WIDGET (widget.webp, 9-slice), beige app-icon tiles, a floating glass dock.
   Home is a bento grid: profile widget (cover photo = timeline frame 1, avatar ring, name, stat chips) · 3 photo widgets
