html body.fs.fs-blood-moon .fsk-soon:not(#_) { display: flex !important; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center !important; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 34px; padding: 0 22px !important; }

/* Skin QA pass 7 (owner, Nov 19): Vaporwave panels are one bevel picture whose grey fades top→bottom. The generic profile-card
   rule tiles it ("round"), so a tall card repeated the fade 2–3× and each restart showed as a line through the card
   (Home #profileCard, #pvProfileCard, old group card). Vaporwave = solid Windows panels: always stretch the art once. */
html body.fs.fs-vaporwave :is(*, *::before, *::after):not(#_):not(#_):not(#_) { border-image-repeat: stretch !important; }
